#. module: midvex_o_notification_telegram
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/midvex_o_notification_telegram/controllers/telegram_webhook.py:0
msgid ""
"VARS notifications bot\n"
"\n"
"/link <code> - connect this chat to your Odoo user\n"
"/status - show whether this chat is connected\n"
"/mute - pause alerts, keeping the connection\n"
"/unmute - resume alerts\n"
"/unlink - disconnect this chat\n"
"/help - show this message\n"
"\n"
"Generate a link code from your Recipient record in Odoo. Codes expire after 15 minutes.\n"
"\n"
"In a group: add this bot to the group first, then send /link there. A personal code will be refused in a group, and a group's code will be refused in a direct message."
msgstr ""

